---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import ContentSection from "~/components/content-section.astro";
---

<ContentSection title="The Perfect LLM Companion" id="intro">
  <Icon slot="eyebrow" name="mdi:notebook-edit-outline" class="size-32" />
  <Fragment slot="lead">
    Immersive Notepad is designed for the <span class="text-primary">LLM era</span>.
    Craft complex prompts in a <span class="text-primary">distraction-free</span> environment,
    organize content across <span class="text-primary">three perfectly-sized</span> notepads,
    and seamlessly transfer them to ChatGPT or any LLM tool.
    <span class="text-primary">Less is more</span> - three notepads are all you need.
  </Fragment>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2">
    <a
      href="#"
      class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border-2 border-purple-500 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 px-6 py-4 transition-colors"
    >
      <Icon name="mdi:download" class="size-8" />
      <span>Install Chrome Extension</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</ContentSection>
